From Oliver Makins at UK AISI
&gt; Hi everyone! UK AISI are looking for <https://job-boards.eu.greenhouse.io/aisi/jobs/4977896101|software engineers> and <https://job-boards.eu.greenhouse.io/aisi/jobs/4978575101|cyber security experts> to join the Cyber and Autonomous Systems team. The deadline for both roles is 11 October 2026.
&gt; 
&gt; We work to equip the UK government and its partners with the scientific understanding of the risks posed by advanced AI. To see more of our team's work, I'd encourage you to check out our <https://www.aisi.gov.uk/blog?category_equal=%5B%22Cyber+%26+Autonomous+Systems%22%5D|blog posts!> :raised_hands:
&gt; 
&gt; The roles are based in London, but we are able to sponsor visas for exceptional candidates. If you're excited by our mission, I'd encourage you to apply!

